# Vendored digital-assets branch `digital-assets` — git attributes.
#
# This branch carries the vendored digital-asset library (templates,
# skills, prompt assets, previews, tool scripts). It is stored on an
# INDEPENDENT branch (not merged into main) and is intended for
# restoration, audit, and controlled distribution. None of these files
# are part of the paper-foundation / agent-loop runtime (those live on
# main). Tracking is here for archival / asset-record purposes only.
#
# 1. Disable linguist detection for the asset tree: a single *.md or
#    *.json inside does not represent the branch's primary language;
#    GitHub should not call it "Markdown" or "JSON" at the repo level.
*           linguist-detectable=false
*           linguist-generated=true

# 2. Binary assets — no text diff, no merge machinery. The v2 tree's
#    binary set: preview images, docx samples, packaged minified libs,
#    and the KaTeX bundle.
*.png       -text diff
*.jpg       -text diff
*.jpeg      -text diff
*.gif       -text diff
*.svg       -text diff
*.ico       -text diff
*.pdf       -text diff
*.docx      -text diff
*.ttf       -text diff
*.ttc       -text diff
*.otf       -text diff
*.woff      -text diff
*.woff2     -text diff
*.eot       -text diff
*.min.js    -text diff
